      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> wrapped in <a href=\"MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.IndexDefinitionHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.IndexDefinitionHolder</code></a> out of <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a> for a given\n<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a> 创建由 <a href=\"MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.IndexDefinitionHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.IndexDefinitionHolder</code></a> 包装的、源自 <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a> 的 <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> wrapped in <a href=\"MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.IndexDefinitionHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.IndexDefinitionHolder</code></a> for <a href=\"CompoundIndexes.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndexes</code></a> of a given\ntype.",
      "translation": "为给定类型的<a href=\"CompoundIndexes.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndexes</code></a>创建由<a href=\"MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.IndexDefinitionHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.IndexDefinitionHolder</code></a>包装的<a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/spel/EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> used for obtaining the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> used to compute\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>expressions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "设置用于获取 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/spel/EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> 的实例，该实例用于计算\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>expressions</code></a> 所需的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create new <a href=\"MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建新的<a href=\"MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的类\"><code>MongoPersistentEntityIndexResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取默认的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Find and create <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s for properties of given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>. <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s\nare created for properties and types with <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a>, <a href=\"CompoundIndexes.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndexes</code></a> or <a href=\"GeoSpatialIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>GeoSpatialIndexed</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定<a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>的属性查找并创建索引定义。对于带有<a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>Indexed</code></a>、<a href=\"CompoundIndexes.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>CompoundIndexes</code></a>或<a href=\"GeoSpatialIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>GeoSpatialIndexed</code></a>的属性及类型，将创建相应的索引定义。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s for a given root entity by traversing\n<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a> scanning for index annotations <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a>, <a href=\"CompoundIndex.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndex</code></a> and\n<a href=\"GeospatialIndex.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>GeospatialIndex</code></a>. The given root has therefore to be annotated with <a href=\"../mapping/Document.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>Document</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析给定根实体对应的<a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>，方法是遍历其<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a>，扫描索引注解 <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a>、<a href=\"CompoundIndex.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndex</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"GeospatialIndex.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>GeospatialIndex</code></a>。因此，该根实体必须带有 <a href=\"../mapping/Document.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>Document</code></a> 注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a> implementation inspecting <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> for <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> to be\nindexed. <br/>\nAll <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a> of the <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> are inspected for potential indexes by\nscanning related annotations.",
      "translation": "实现类会检查<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a>，以确定哪些实体需要创建索引。<br/>\n该实现还会扫描相关注解，以检查<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a>的所有<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a>，从而确定潜在的索引。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s for a given root entity by traversing\n<a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a> scanning for index annotations <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a>, <a href=\"CompoundIndex.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndex</code></a> and\n<a href=\"GeospatialIndex.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>GeospatialIndex</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析给定根实体对应的 <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>，通过遍历 <a href=\"../mapping/MongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentProperty</code></a> 并扫描索引注解 <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a>、<a href=\"CompoundIndex.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndex</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"GeospatialIndex.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>GeospatialIndex</code></a> 来实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Find and create <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s for properties of given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>的属性创建<a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"IndexResolver.html#resolveIndexFor(org.springframework.data.core.TypeInformation)\">IndexResolver</a></code></span>",
