    {
      "source": "Empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> in case no <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> could be resolved for type.",
